<title>USA: Group files for 1.25 million share offer.</title>
<headline>Group files for 1.25 million share offer.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group Long Distance Inc said Friday it has filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 1.25 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>LT Lawrence &amp; Co Inc will manage the underwriting group.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the proceeds of this offering to expand its sales and marketing activities and to repay corporate debt.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
